    ],
    "source_notes": [
      {
        "text": "The root models entry documents the shared architecture factory, Phi3 fused-weight fallback and Gemma post-normalization construction. The DeciLM entry documents reuse of the same module and input-preparation interfaces. These entries supply historical context, not GLM execution evidence.",
        "basis": "ancestor",
