          "call_a7125fdd151e4e9f939aad43ca5b07dd"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "The GPTJ entry records native adjacent-pair rotation and an inherited partial-frequency bounds concern. The immediate-parent entry records FP32 linear outputs and an unsupported FP32 MLP-intermediate option.",
