      },
      {
        "text": "Issue #7, \u201cquantizing model: undefined symbol: __cxa_call_terminate,\u201d reports an extension-import failure and a reporter-supplied environment workaround. Issue #15, \u201c`cogito-v1-preview-qwen-32B` generates incoherent output for bpw <= 2.5,\u201d discusses quantization regularization and reconversion. PR #4, \u201cchore: update config.py,\u201d proposes a spelling correction. None identifies GLM4 support as its remedy.",
